    <tbody>{cond_model_rows}</tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  <div class="insight green">
    <strong>Key Finding:</strong> Condition is the second-most powerful driver of resale value after model selection. Deadstock pairs command a substantial premium over VNDS, which in turn significantly outperforms Used. The premium gap between Deadstock and Used conditions is dramatic — representing the single largest controllable factor in resale pricing. Deadstock pairs achieve premium rates near or above 80% while Used pairs fall below 50%, with corresponding differences in absolute profit per transaction.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ════ SECTION 4: CHANNEL PERFORMANCE ════ -->
<div class="section">
