<!-- ════ SECTION 6: RECOMMENDATIONS ════ -->
<div class="section">
  <h2>6. Key Findings &amp; Strategic Recommendations</h2>
  <div class="section-desc">Synthesized insights and actionable recommendations for resellers regarding model selection, optimal sales channels, inventory holding periods, and timing strategies.</div>

  <div class="rec-grid">
    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">Strategy 01</div>
      <h4>Prioritize High-Premium Models</h4>
      <p>Focus sourcing on the top 3–4 performing Air Jordan models which command the highest average profit margins and strongest premium rates. These models consistently outperform the market average and offer the best risk-adjusted returns for resellers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">Strategy 02</div>
      <h4>Match Condition to Channel</h4>
      <p>Allocate Deadstock inventory to high-margin channels for maximum profit capture. Route Used and VNDS pairs through faster-moving platforms to optimize cash flow and minimize holding costs. The channel-condition fit is a force multiplier on profitability.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">Strategy 03</div>
      <h4>Time Entries and Exits Seasonally</h4>
      <p>Align buying with seasonal dips in resale pricing and sell into peak-demand windows. Transaction volume and margins show predictable seasonal patterns that can be exploited for 10–20% margin improvement on well-timed trades.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">Strategy 04</div>
      <h4>Target Colorways with Pricing Power</h4>
      <p>The top-performing colorways — particularly <strong>{kpis['top_colorway_name']}</strong> (avg {fmt_usd(kpis['top_colorway_margin'])} profit) — demonstrate sustained pricing power. Prioritize these in sourcing decisions and be willing to pay above retail at acquisition for the right colorways.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">Strategy 05</div>
      <h4>Manage Inventory Velocity Actively</h4>
      <p>Set holding-period thresholds: if a pair hasn't sold within 25–30 days (above the market average of {kpis['avg_days_inventory']} days), consider price adjustments or channel switching. The opportunity cost of tied-up capital compounds quickly across a portfolio.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">Strategy 06</div>
      <h4>Minimize Used-Inventory Exposure</h4>
      <p>Used-condition pairs generate the lowest margins and highest loss rates. Limit sourcing to high-demand colorways even in Used condition, and price aggressively to maintain velocity. The carrying cost of slow-moving Used inventory erodes already-thin margins.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

