    <div class="kpi-sub">Top colorway: {kpis['top_colorway_name']} ({fmt_usd(kpis['top_colorway_margin'])})</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ════ SECTION 1: MARKET OVERVIEW ════ -->
<div class="section">
  <h2>1. Market Overview &amp; Transaction Summary</h2>
  <div class="section-desc">High-level summary of the dataset, pricing distributions, and overall profit landscape across {fmt(summ['total_transactions'])} transactions.</div>

  <div class="stat-pills">
    <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Avg Retail</span> <span class="val">{fmt_usd(summ['avg_retail_price'])}</span></div>
    <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Avg Resale</span> <span class="val">{fmt_usd(summ['avg_resale_price'])}</span></div>
    <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Std Dev Profit</span> <span class="val">{fmt_usd(summ['std_profit_margin'])}</span></div>
    <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">% Above Retail</span> <span class="val">{summ['pct_above_retail']}%</span></div>
    <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">% Below Retail</span> <span class="val">{summ['pct_below_retail']}%</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-box">
      <canvas id="profitDistChart"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-box">
      <canvas id="ratioDistChart"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight">
    <strong>Key Finding:</strong> The average transaction clears at <strong>{fmt_usd(summ['avg_resale_price'])}</strong> against a <strong>{fmt_usd(summ['avg_retail_price'])}</strong> average retail price, yielding a mean profit of <strong>{fmt_usd(summ['avg_profit_margin'])}</strong>. {summ['pct_above_retail']}% of all transactions are profitable, while {summ['pct_below_retail']}% sell below retail — nearly 2 in 5 transactions result in a loss. The profit distribution is right-skewed with a long tail of high-premium outliers (max: {fmt_usd(summ['max_profit'])}), indicating that a minority of highly coveted pairs drive outsized returns.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ════ SECTION 2: MODEL & COLORWAY PERFORMANCE ════ -->
<div class="section">
  <h2>2. Performance by Shoe Model &amp; Colorway</h2>
  <div class="section-desc">Ranking of Air Jordan models and colorways by average resale price, profit margin, and transaction volume. Identifies highest-premium and below-retail segments.</div>

  <h3>Model Ranking by Average Profit Margin</h3>
  <div class="table-wrap">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>#</th><th>Model</th><th>Transactions</th><th>Avg Retail</th><th>Avg Resale</th><th>Avg Profit</th><th>Premium Rate</th><th>Avg Days</th></tr>
    </thead>
