      <canvas id="seasonProfitChart"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-box">
      <canvas id="seasonVolumeChart"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-full">
    <div class="chart-box">
      <canvas id="quarterlyTrendsChart"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight purple">
    <strong>Key Finding:</strong> Temporal patterns reveal meaningful seasonality in both pricing and volume. Profit margins and transaction counts show distinct seasonal swings tied to release calendars and holiday-driven demand. Inventory velocity also fluctuates — understanding these rhythms can meaningfully improve both buy and sell timing decisions.
